{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:27:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_de028427457b4d28aea19d142a1bb409","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_529ae893abf637d42048e603b9c207f5a9539308ae2a8d90d45978902fa8b581","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"trypromptly/llmstack@701348426fad snapshot 99e229211c89b3bc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9f38011ac694d77d0f8ffddf8097a05496635e73d781840df893c6fa07af8da6"],"source_ids":["src_44e60023ac6c5bbf96a13df01bbfb9d7"],"text":"The platform imports data types such as CSV, TXT, PDF, DOCX, and PPTX from sources like Google Drive, Notion, websites, and uploads, then preprocesses and vectorizes it into an out-of-the-box vector database.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:27:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_de028427457b4d28aea19d142a1bb409"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:27:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_de028427457b4d28aea19d142a1bb409","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_82a5924e8a6fa220f2a908c991e5dd8c431f13a529bbedf7d6c64da678a2a9f8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"trypromptly/llmstack@701348426fad snapshot 99e229211c89b3bc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_f34d335dca4d42c29d9ac67a675871956f8bc6287ac9cc0acedecbd7debcf22f","slc_fddcd6c7f8885ad95db08ce3581ff3f2402b3638a192f5a77f52ac48af77b66f"],"source_ids":["src_44e60023ac6c5bbf96a13df01bbfb9d7"],"text":"Apps and chatbots built with LLMStack are accessible via an HTTP API, and AI chains can be triggered from Slack or Discord.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:27:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_de028427457b4d28aea19d142a1bb409"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:27:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_de028427457b4d28aea19d142a1bb409","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8e1aa3539afa8ba79a52e218b04d1782046a15f40025fa56e8b28499655edd8c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"trypromptly/llmstack@701348426fad snapshot 99e229211c89b3bc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3d357914dc477d27d3a4de88e7b00ed572154236a0600adeee08e966615153dd","slc_610f18e065884adbc3b025b6529044f4bbe45684419b6f1edab3942338f2b00f","slc_f364e135c5535d65e58b0eba8944dfc72419e93fee943ad01cc44a8549acae4f"],"source_ids":["src_44e60023ac6c5bbf96a13df01bbfb9d7"],"text":"LLMStack is installed with 'pip install llmstack' and started with the 'llmstack' command; Windows users are directed to use WSL2.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:27:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_de028427457b4d28aea19d142a1bb409"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:27:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_de028427457b4d28aea19d142a1bb409","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c8b27b667a39b21f951c65d2b597d7138e39d239e276f981aeadcd774a76c82a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"trypromptly/llmstack@701348426fad snapshot 99e229211c89b3bc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_20311589e10ddba2dd9daa779f927bee49f25a17ec883bdcb9aeaa553e08e2f5","slc_ef6a66d123895eab7a9b138ed61019e559f732e7aebd5985bef527d145e6c61a","slc_fb9545fd993d662382aa43cf1a69d482e16a72b6f8b3d6a26fd1c99ff9a72008"],"source_ids":["src_44e60023ac6c5bbf96a13df01bbfb9d7"],"text":"The platform lets users chain multiple LLMs together to build generative AI applications without coding, via a no-code builder.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:27:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_de028427457b4d28aea19d142a1bb409"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:27:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_de028427457b4d28aea19d142a1bb409","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_cacd7bafe2215e6c96412e95c28f83a6222ef60e1a6448fedf23ed21d62c4ddf","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"trypromptly/llmstack@701348426fad snapshot 99e229211c89b3bc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_d3de3cf8a1c9db54503fbc3ca3526bc9dfec1362709da58a286ba9fe34e2ac1e"],"source_ids":["src_44e60023ac6c5bbf96a13df01bbfb9d7"],"text":"LLMStack is multi-tenant: users can create multiple organizations, and users can only access data and AI chains belonging to their organization.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:27:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_de028427457b4d28aea19d142a1bb409"}
